  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28539001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "You，过来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28539003",
              "text": "竟然是伊达政宗！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28539002",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Wait，说了多少次，叫我「家督大人」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "咳……家，督大人，突然到来是有什么事吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "I see，你看起来的确有些不一样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "有没有兴趣加入我的「伊达军」？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28539008",
              "text": "可我什么都不会啊。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28539007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "我的队伍里到处都是什么都不会的混混，who care。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "So，你不用担心这个。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28539011",
              "text": "这下我更迷惑了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28539011",
              "text": "所以招我去干嘛？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28539010",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "还没想好，but，有你在的话，找麻烦的人就会变少。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28539013",
              "text": "这是要我去做门神？！"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28539012",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28539013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "伊达政宗",
          "text": "Certainly.",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
